{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fishing_dock","model_identifier":"fishing_dock","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# fishing_dock\n\nFishing dock: a plank jetty on stilts out over the water (north, -Z; the stilts go 24 u below y 0 into the water), nets drying on poles and a small boat shed with a rowing boat.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 10 columns (128 x 160 units, 3.60 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -63..61, y -24..70, z -80..68 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 36, construction_0 34, construction_33 40, construction_66 45, ruined 26 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- jetty: 24 x 9 x 120 centred at x 0, z -20 (walkable deck at y 9)\n- boat shed: 48 x 74 x 68 centred at x -38, z 32\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `fishing_dock_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `fishing_dock_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_fishing_dock` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 9, 30)\n- `slot_fish_1` at (-8, 9, -76)\n- `slot_fish_2` at (8, 9, -76)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"jetty","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-12.0,6.0,-80.0],"to":[12.0,9.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[94.0,239.0,118.0,242.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,236.0,120.0,239.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[94.0,239.0,118.0,242.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,236.0,120.0,239.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,28.0,120.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,28.0,120.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3cae268f-d6a2-5553-9c03-5c3338cc16e8"},{"name":"stilt0-1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-12.0,-24.0,-78.0],"to":[-8.0,6.0,-74.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[167.0,154.0,171.0,184.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[171.0,154.0,175.0,184.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[167.0,154.0,171.0,184.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[171.0,154.0,175.0,184.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[139.0,230.0,143.0,234.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[139.0,230.0,143.0,234.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"76d54453-2f3f-533d-88b5-6c69f8ea0ebd"},{"name":"stilt01","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[8.0,-24.0,-78.0],"to":[12.0,6.0,-74.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[175.0,154.0,179.0,184.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[171.0,154.0,175.0,184.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[175.0,154.0,179.0,184.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[171.0,154.0,175.0,184.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[143.0,230.0,147.0,234.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[143.0,230.0,147.0,234.0],"textur